   "text": "\"Hello, Rabbit,\" said Bear. \"Do you have any eggs? I want to bake a cake.\" \"I have some eggs,\" said Rabbit. \"What is the cake for?\" \"It's my birthday, and I'm having a party,\" said Bear. Bear thanked Rabbit and took the eggs. Then he went home. \"Why didn't Bear ask me to his party?\" Rabbit asked sadly.",
